<div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-offset-1 col-sm-10">
      <h1>About This PheWeb</h1>
<br>

<p>This site was built with <a href="https://github.com/statgen/pheweb/">PheWeb</a> 
version 1.3.16. using build GRCh38. 
The summary statistics downloads are in the build used in the relevant publications 
(i.e. Pozarickij, A., et al. 2024 and Walters, R.G., et al. 2023, are in the build GRCh37.)
</p>

<div class="panel panel-primary">
    <div class="panel-heading">The GWAS results on this website are from the following studies:</div>
    <div class="panel-body list-group">
        <a href="https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.1101/2023.11.13.23298365" target="_blank" class="list-group-item">
            <h4 class="list-group-item-heading">Ancestry diversity in the genetic determinants of the human plasma proteome enhances identification of potential drug targets</h4>
            <p class="list-group-item-text">Pozarickij, A., et al. <i>Medrxiv</i> (2025)</p> 
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-024-50297-x" target="_blank" class="list-group-item">
		<h4 class="list-group-item-heading">Causal relevance of different blood pressure traits on risk of cardiovascular diseases: GWAS and Mendelian randomisation in 100,000 Chinese adults</h4>
            <p class="list-group-item-text">Pozarickij, A., et al. <i>Nature Communications 15, 6265</i> (2024)</p> 
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.cell.com/cell-genomics/fulltext/S2666-979X(23)00144-1" target="_blank" class="list-group-item">
            <h4 class="list-group-item-heading">Genotyping and population characteristics of the China Kadoorie Biobank</h4>   
            <p class="list-group-item-text">Walters, R.G., et al. <i>Cell Genomics 3, 100361</i> (2023)</p> 
        </a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="panel panel-default">
