<div class="panel panel-primary">
    <div class="panel-heading">Data Usage Policies and Disclaimers</div>
    <div class="panel-body">
            <p>Before using data and services provided by the CKB PheWeb browser, please read and understand this statement. When you access the website or use provided information directly or indirectly, you are agreeing to the following usage policies and disclaimers.</p>
			<p><b>Disclaimers</b></p>
			<p>CKB provides data under a CC BY 4.0 license.</p>
			<p>While CKB endeavours to provide accurate data, CKB makes no representation or warranty of any kind about data completeness, accuracy, or reliability, and CKB accepts no liability to you or third parties for any loss or damage arising from their use.</p>
			<p>CKB does not endorse or recommend any commercial products, processes, or services. Any views expressed on the CKB PheWeb do not necessarily state or reflect those of CKB, and they may not be used for advertising or product endorsement purposes.<p/>
			<p>The CKB PheWeb may provide links to other websites for the convenience of users. CKB is not responsible for the availability or content of these external sites, nor does CKB endorse, warrant, or guarantee the products, services, or information described or offered at these other websites. Users cannot assume that the external sites will abide by the same Usage Policy to which CKB adheres. It is the responsibility of the user to examine the copyright and licensing restrictions of linked pages and to secure all necessary permissions.</p>
			<p>CKB PheWeb does not support or provide pop-up advertisements. Any advertisements observed by users should be assumed to be due to other websites or third party software installed on your computer. CKB does not endorse or recommend products or services for which you may view a pop-up advertisement while visiting our site, and CKB assumes no responsibility for data errors or information disclosure.</p>
			<p>We will retain our commitment to Usage Policies and Disclaimers, but we reserve the right to update this statement at any time. When alterations are inevitable, we will attempt to give reasonable notice of any changes by placing a notice on our website, but you may wish to check each time you use the website. The date of the most recent revision will appear on this page. If you do not agree to these changes, please do not continue to use our online services.</p>
			<p><b>Privacy Policies</b></p>
			<p>CKB respects and protects users' personal privacy rights. No cookies are used by this site, and no personal information is collected. We reserve the right to collect web traffic data, including IP addresses, for recording and monitoring data downloads and to ensure smooth and secure operation of the website. This information is not used for associating search terms or patterns of site navigation with individual users. When search features offer suggested terms, these suggestions are based on aggregated data only.</p>
			<p><b>Ethics Policies</b></p>
			<p>CKB is committed to providing users with data so as to comply with relevant laws, regulations, and bioethics. Data provided on this site were generated in compliance with the ethical permissions of the CKB study, as approved in China and the UK. In using this site and using the data for scientific research, the data user agrees to shall abide by all applicable laws and regulations, relevant scientific research norms, and ethical principles.</p>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="panel panel-primary">
    <div class="panel-heading">Accessing summary statistics</div>
    <div class="panel-body" id="download_instruction">
            <p>To comply with Chinese government regulations, summary statistics files hosted on this site are encrypted.  Decryption keys are available on application. Please send an email with subject "CKB summary statistics request" to <a href="mailto:ckbaccess@ndph.ox.ac.uk?subject=CKB&nbsp;summary&nbsp;statistics&nbsp;request">ckbaccess@ndph.ox.ac.uk</a> with the following details:</p>
			<pre>
			Name:
			Institution:
			Address:
			Institutional email:
			</pre>
			<p>By sending this email, you agree not to share these decryption keys with third parties, and not to share decrypted summary statistics outside your immediate research group.</p>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
</footer>
